<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>World snooker championship semifinal result on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding, best of 33 frames): 7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) beat 14-Alain Robidoux (Canada) 17-7</p>
